    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d336">

                <pb facs="0345" n="1023" xml:id="pg1023"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Kreismann to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">No. 9.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Berlin</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 5, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>S<hi rendition="#small-caps">ir:</hi> * * * * * * * *</p>
                <p>The outbreak in New York, amidst all the cheering successes of our arms, is
                    indeed a sad and disgraceful affair; but the determination of the government to
                    maintain the supremacy of the laws, and to enforce them, will make it subserve
                    the interests and triumph of our cause.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>H. KREISMANN.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William</hi> H. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Seward</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, &amp;c.,
                            &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
